    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42024" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">runco</span></b> , āre, v. a.
		runca, runcina, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to weed out</i>, <i>root up; to
			weed</i>, <i>clear of weeds.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spinas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">segetes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 30</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Col. 11, 2, 40</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 18,
				21, 50, § 184</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tert.
				Pall. 2 <i>med.</i></span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b> * </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>To pluck</i>, <i>deprive of its
			hair</i>, <i><span class="en">Pers. 4, 35</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>To mow</i>: frumenta, Aug. Civ. Dei, 4, 8 <i>med.</i></div>
